# Claude Code
.claude/worktrees/
# Holds machine-specific state: Metals writes its MCP port, picked on a machine's first run, into it (and into
# .metals/mcp.json) and reuses it on later starts, and bin/mtlist-dev-stack adds the scoverage-inspector server with
# absolute paths. Keep the file: once both files are gone, Metals picks a new port under running Claude Code sessions.
.mcp.json

